  "note": "Lean has no counterpart of Lemma 9.1.3 and no N(T,χ) integral; it counts zeros in 4.4-wide windows by Jensen's formula and sums a geometric series. The decreasing-f clause of Lemma 9.1.3 omits the boundary term f(T₀)g_χ(T₀); the Lean route does not need it."
